- Separate pure logic from rendering. Review the algorithms for correctness (eviction order for each policy offered; hop counts and path selection for routing). Add unit tests for the pure logic if a test runner exists or a minimal one (such as Vitest) is justified.
- Pause animation when offscreen or the tab is hidden. Cap canvas DPR at 2. Under reduced motion: no autoplay, step-driven.
- Acceptance: deterministic for a given seed; fully operable by keyboard; usable at 360px with controls below the canvas.

